    "rel_path": "guide.md",
    "text": "# Parity Guide\n\nThis synthetic guide exists only for ingestion parity tests. It describes a\nsmall lending library that tracks books, members, and loans.",
    "text_sha256": "094dec962258d2536f653675103c0d3f1d3d6a62b179537322a3050a73dc34b0"
  },
  {
    "metadata": {
      "content_type": "document/markdown",
      "file_type": "text/markdown",
      "header_path": "/Parity Guide/",
      "source_chunk_count": 4,
      "source_chunk_index": 1,
      "source_content_hash": "d6ee11ac95ea37a6a1e455bdb52f950e25dc5a5d9310d98611f5e27bbd79d739"
    },
    "rel_path": "guide.md",
    "text": "## Members\n\nEach member has a card number and a home branch. A member can borrow up to\nfive books at one time. Overdue loans block new loans until the member\nreturns the overdue items.",
    "text_sha256": "472ac1b0cdce5c2a56dab58fc6473bd59f1ed9be37b7815009fd814fcc8dfa38"
  },
  {
    "metadata": {
      "content_type": "document/markdown",
      "file_type": "text/markdown",
      "header_path": "/Parity Guide/",
      "source_chunk_count": 4,
      "source_chunk_index": 2,
      "source_content_hash": "d6ee11ac95ea37a6a1e455bdb52f950e25dc5a5d9310d98611f5e27bbd79d739"
    },
    "rel_path": "guide.md",
    "text": "## Loans\n\nA loan starts when the desk scans the book and the card. The default loan\nperiod is fourteen days. Members can renew a loan twice if no other member\nhas reserved the book.",
    "text_sha256": "9563df4a046fcc6df20ab4634b7fd9215f2b55ada463df310100256487035733"
  },
  {
    "metadata": {
      "content_type": "document/markdown",
      "file_type": "text/markdown",
      "header_path": "/Parity Guide/Loans/",
      "source_chunk_count": 4,
      "source_chunk_index": 3,
      "source_content_hash": "d6ee11ac95ea37a6a1e455bdb52f950e25dc5a5d9310d98611f5e27bbd79d739"
    },
    "rel_path": "guide.md",
    "text": "### Reservations\n\nA reservation holds a returned book at the desk for three days. The system\nsends one notice when the book arrives and one reminder on the last day.",
    "text_sha256": "df9335cc0cf910591a1c9191a8a096d45e4690a8f6904114e36a767aed392b09"
  },
  {
    "metadata": {
      "content_type": "document/markdown",
      "file_type": "text/markdown",
      "header_path": "/",
      "source_chunk_count": 3,
      "source_chunk_index": 0,
      "source_content_hash": "df07c4ddc467db3704e3687849e17bce1d68e22d140abcfc22c21cc823ef4933"
    },
    "rel_path": "nested/appendix.md",
    "text": "# Appendix",
    "text_sha256": "da5468179b661343e2a9b776682b90b6bc01a2b8a76d4a93c2466b1876f41ae1"
  },
  {
    "metadata": {
      "content_type": "document/markdown",
      "file_type": "text/markdown",
      "header_path": "/Appendix/",
      "source_chunk_count": 3,
      "source_chunk_index": 1,
      "source_content_hash": "df07c4ddc467db3704e3687849e17bce1d68e22d140abcfc22c21cc823ef4933"
    },
    "rel_path": "nested/appendix.md",
    "text": "## Fines\n\nThe library charges no fines for children's books. Adult books carry a small\ndaily charge after the grace period of two days.",
    "text_sha256": "d9f506b82bf9a0935aa3cf936b7501ab1097609ebd1a634fa1cfe837cead3bde"
  },
  {
    "metadata": {
      "content_type": "document/markdown",
      "file_type": "text/markdown",
      "header_path": "/Appendix/",
      "source_chunk_count": 3,
      "source_chunk_index": 2,
      "source_content_hash": "df07c4ddc467db3704e3687849e17bce1d68e22d140abcfc22c21cc823ef4933"
    },
    "rel_path": "nested/appendix.md",
    "text": "## Lost items\n\nA member who loses a book pays the replacement cost. The desk refunds the\ncharge if the member finds and returns the book within ninety days.",
    "text_sha256": "d34a8e600a7c02af4cc86fcd8d09deb92272ffb55804a5cefdb97caac827d0fa"
  },
  {
    "metadata": {
      "content_type": "document/text",
