      "source_chunk_index": 0,
      "source_content_hash": "2480f51909c04d52a560abd03ad7d161e373f21f6af07f15395932c9dacef2c4"
    },
    "rel_path": "notes.txt",
    "text": "Branch opening notes.\n\nThe north branch opens at nine in the morning on weekdays and at ten on\nSaturdays. It closes on Sundays and on public holidays.\n\nThe south branch shares the same hours but keeps a late opening until eight\nin the evening on Thursdays. Study rooms at the south branch need a booking\nmade at least one day in advance.\n\nBoth branches accept returns through an outside drop box at any hour. Staff\nclear the drop box at opening time and check each item before they close\nthe loan.",
    "text_sha256": "c0d9e9f7fd46093b6ab3d3efdbff47e1eab6700264e0a77ec133a6089735c819"
  }
]
